---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import DealForm from '../components/DealForm.astro';
import {brand,city,site} from '../data/city';
const page=city.pages.privacy;
---
<Base title={`${page.title} | ${brand}`} description={page.description} path={page.path}><Header/><main id="main"><section class="legal-hero"><div class="container legal-hero__inner"><div><h1>{page.h1}</h1><p>{page.intro}</p></div><DealForm cityName={site.legalCityName} location={site.legalLocation}/></div></section><div class="container legal"><p>We collect the name, phone, email and project details you submit so we can respond to your request and discuss possible funding connections. We may share relevant details with the lending partner to evaluate a possible match, and their own privacy practices may apply if you choose to work with them.</p><h2>Analytics and tracking</h2><p>Analytics and form tracking tools may collect page visits, device details, approximate location and submitted form data. We use these tools to understand site activity and route inquiries. Browser settings may allow you to restrict cookies.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>We use your information to review your inquiry, contact you and operate this website. Service providers may process it on our behalf. We may also disclose information where legally required. We do not claim that a form submission will result in funding.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can ask about, correct or request deletion of the information you submitted by using the form on this website. We may retain information where needed for legitimate business or legal reasons.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy. The current text is posted on this page.</p></div></main><Footer/></Base>
